{"title":"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> be the length of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Hypotenuse\" title=\"Hypotenuse\">hypotenuse</a> of a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Right_triangle\" title=\"Right triangle\">right triangle</a> whose two other sides have lengths <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />. Prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/7/e77a6d61ed023532378382ab7e03985dcfd8125a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b\\le c\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"96\" height=\"19\" />. When does the equality hold?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We square both sides of the equation to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/2/8723e63c56cc782952cc23d5426d33c9056b2b27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2+b^2+2ab \\leq 2c^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"154\" height=\"19\" />. Since , by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pythagorean_Theorem\" title=\"Pythagorean Theorem\">Pythagorean Theorem</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/b/7fbd4264fbec874b1c14992abd59ea22d4daf604.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 + b^2 = c^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"93\" height=\"16\" />, allowing us to reduce the original inequality to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/c/47c9882e46c45e14462bf849ae1b8bd0beb2d64d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2ab \\leq c^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"68\" height=\"19\" />. By AM-GM, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/9/449021ef4fd5d36d262ce3d893c9559a49bba3cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2ab \\leq a^2 + b^2 = c^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"147\" height=\"19\" />, which leads to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/c/47c9882e46c45e14462bf849ae1b8bd0beb2d64d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2ab \\leq c^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"68\" height=\"19\" />, proving the original inequality.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO\">1969 Canadian MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 10\">10</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017170045\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.024 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 73/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1021/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 60/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1635/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.609      1 Template:Old_CanadaMO_box\n100.00%    8.609      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache